@page "/"

<PageTitle>SPE Chapter — Home</PageTitle><!-- ─── SECTION 1: Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="relative flex items-end"
         style="background-image:url('/images/bg1.png'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; min-height:65vh;">
    <!-- dark tint overlay -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:rgba(0,30,80,0.35);"></div>

    <!-- "About Us?" title bottom-left -->
    <div class="relative z-10 px-8 pb-20 md:px-16">
        <h1 class="text-white font-extrabold" style="font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem);">About Us?</h1>
    </div>

    <!-- White wave at bottom -->
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 leading-none">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 70" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none" class="w-full"
             style="height:70px; display:block;">
            <path d="M0,70 L0,35 Q360,0 720,28 Q1080,56 1440,20 L1440,70 Z" fill="white" />
        </svg>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 2: About Us body ────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="bg-white py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
            The SPE Student Chapter at the University of Aberdeen is more than just a student society — we are your
            direct connection to the Society of Petroleum Engineers (SPE), the world's largest community dedicated to
            the oil, gas, and energy industry.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our role is to introduce students to the industry and guide them toward the wealth of opportunities SPE
            offers. From technical lectures, international competitions, and networking events to publishing papers,
            pursuing chartership, and applying for scholarships through SPE International, we make sure our members are
            well informed and well prepared to take full advantage of what SPE has to offer.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 3: Cards ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="py-20 px-6"
         style="background-image:url('/images/bg2.png'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 text-slate-800 leading-relaxed shadow-md">
            We serve as the link between students and SPE International ensuring our members are aware of the many
            opportunities available. From technical talks and career workshops to global competitions and publishing
            platforms, we help students navigate and make the most of what SPE provides.
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 text-slate-800 leading-relaxed shadow-md">
            Most importantly, we are open to all students, no matter your academic background. If you're curious about
            the oil, gas, and wider energy industry — from traditional resources to the evolving energy transition — you
            are welcome here.
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 4: Why Join Us ───────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="relative py-16 px-6"
         style="background-image:url('/images/bg3.png'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; min-height:520px;">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-color:rgba(0,30,80,0.55);"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-xl py-8 md:ml-16">
        <h2 class="text-white font-extrabold mb-8" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.75rem);">Why Join Us?</h2>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 text-slate-800 leading-relaxed shadow-md ">
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xl">
                <li>• Connect directly with industry experts and future employers.</li>
                <li>• Gain access to technical lectures, competitions abroad, and international events.</li>
                <li>• Learn about scholarship opportunities, publishing platforms, and professional development paths offered by SPE International.</li>
                <li>• Be part of a global network of more than 360 student chapters across the world.</li>
                <li>• Grow personally and professionally in a community that values knowledge, collaboration, and innovation.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── SECTION 5: Our Vision ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="py-24 px-6 text-center"
         style="background-image:url('/images/bg4.png'); background-size:cover; background-position:center;">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-white font-extrabold mb-10" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.75rem);">Our Vision</h2>
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 text-slate-800 leading-relaxed shadow-md">
            To empower students with the knowledge, skills, and connections they need to thrive in the energy industry while promoting a culture of safety, responsibility, and sustainability.
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
            
